    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44717" root="&#xA;                        وكل&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَلَهُ إِلَى رَأْيِهِ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكْلٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُكُولٌ</span>, <i>He
left him to his opinion,</i> or <i>judgment.</i> (TA.)
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَلْتُهُ إِلَى نَفْسِهِ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَكِلُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُكُولٌ</span>,
[<i>I left him to himself;</i>] <i>I did not manage his
affair, nor aid him.</i> (Msb.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِلْنِى إِلَى</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَذَا</span>
                        <i>Leave thou me to manage such a thing.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَلْتُهُ إِلَى دِينِهِ</span> [<i>I left him to his
religion, not interfering with him therein</i>].
(S, Msb, K, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَيَّنْتُهُ</span>.)

